OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear big bill for
OL,4,Amonth-long water leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FElderly residents at a block of flats
OL,7,Fin Sutton Coldfield say they fear they
OL,8,Fcould be left with a repair bill they
OL,9,Fcannot afford after being told they may
OL,10,Fhave to pay to fix a water leak outside
OL,11,Ftheir homes.
OL,13,FWater has been flowing beneath a
OL,14,Fservice road at Banners Court, off
OL,15,FBanners Gate Road, for almost a month.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
