OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear big bill for
OL,4,Amonth-long water leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living there, many of whom are
OL,7,Felderly or have disabilities, say their
OL,8,Fdeeds clearly show the leak is on
OL,9,Fcouncil land and not their
OL,10,Fresponsibility, but both Birmingham
OL,11,FCity Council and Severn Trent say the
OL,12,Fland and water supply is private.
OL,14,FSome are facing difficulty accessing
OL,15,Fhomes with mobility scooters and
OL,16,Fwheelchairs.
